cera-ffi-android third-party notices
=====================================

This library embeds prebuilt Qualcomm Hexagon DSP worker libraries
(`libcera-htp-v73.so`, `libcera-htp-v75.so`, `libcera-htp-v79.so`,
`libcera-htp-v81.so`, `libcera-htp-v85.so`, inside libcera_ffi.so). They are compiled from
llama.cpp sources plus one patch to the Q8 activation quantizer
(in the cera repository under
